          {
            "id": "/page/929/Text/3",
            "block_type": "Text",
            "html": "<p block-type=\"Text\">Any other markings, such as marking of non-ASME or non-ASTM material specifications, have no relevance, even if those markings are for materials explicitly prohibited by the construction code being used. That is, as long</p>",
            "polygon": [
              [
                50.62299728393555,
